Package: synology-ds2415p
Version: 1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: synodeb <synodeb@localhost>
Depends: linux-image-ds923, python3 (>= 3.11), hdparm, ethtool, util-linux, systemd, coreutils
Conflicts: synology-ds923
Recommends: smartmontools, lm-sensors, mdadm
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/rylos/synodeb
Description: Debian on the Synology DS2415+: hardware control
 synohwd for the front-panel microcontroller of the DS2415+ (ttyS1): fan duty
 from DSM's tables, keepalive, status and alert LEDs, beeper, power-on after
 an AC loss, scheduled power-on, Wake-on-LAN. With the kernel driver
 synology_ds2415p (kernel built with EXTRA_CONFIGS=ds2415p.config) it also
 drives the orange bay LEDs and the DX1215 expansion unit: fan level from the
 DX1215 disk temperatures, fan alarms, bay LEDs.
